  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nWhen we send a room invite event to a specific user, the user doesn't receive any invite notification (tested in Element Web) and cannot see or access the room. Also when directly calling the `/sync` endpoint no events concerning the room are received. However other users can see that the user has been invited.\r\n\r\nThis seems similar to https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/10022 but we already checked that no entries are set in the `ignored_users` and `rejections` tables.\r\n\r\nAlso we cleared the cache in Element Web and did a full reload, still the invite doesn't get received.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nSend the following event:\r\n\r\n![Bildschirmfoto 2021-12-21 um 15 45 50](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2392542/146951374-74ac08b2-f5f1-43f9-a417-79d3294fbbd9.png)\r\n\r\nThe user doesn't receive the invite though.\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\n- **Homeserver**: chat.church.tools\r\n- **Version**: 1.49.0\r\n\r\n\r\n",
